   <transaction-date iso-date="2020-05-27"></transaction-date>
   <value currency="USD" value-date="2020-05-27">50000000</value>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The trade finance risk sharing programme with Societe Generale enables CDC to support local businesses and importers across Africa by increasing access to trade credit, a need that is enhanced during COVID-19 with disruptions in supply chains and an increasing retrenchment of capital. The facility allows the bank to extend the limits for local banks, which in turn strengthens its ability to provide critical funding to local importers for essential inputs and commodities. In 2021 we made an increase to the programme.</narrative>
   </description>
